                                                "sense_id": "6edbe980-d7f3-34a3-a2b6-d7a65722c2a5",
                                                "text": "As he waited for his seminar to begin, a “very tall, handsome” man walked in. “He was strapping,” Browde recalled decades later, and everyone looked up and clocked him."
                                            }
                                        ]
